{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":0,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"He couldn't adapt to new circumstances.","ja":"彼は新しい環境に適応できなかった。","ref":"299870_103822","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He tried to adapt himself to his new surroundings.","ja":"彼は新しい環境に適応しようと努力した。","ref":"299869_103823","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He is quick to adapt to new circumstances.","ja":"彼は新しい環境に順応するのが早い。","ref":"299868_103824","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He quickly accustomed himself to his new surroundings.","ja":"彼は新しい環境にすばやく慣れた。","ref":"299867_103825","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He can't accommodate himself to his circumstances.","ja":"彼は環境に順応できない。","ref":"294928_108760","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["環境","還境"],"glosses":["environment","surroundings","circumstances"],"id":"1213280","lemma":"環境","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"カンキョウ","readings":["かんきょう"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/環境#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/環/環境/環境.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["影響人類及其他生物賴以生活、生存的空間、資源","生態"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["影響人類及其他生物賴以生活、生存的空間、資源"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["生態"],"pos":"n"}]},{"common":false,"forms":["環境グループ"],"glosses":["environmental group"],"id":"1213290","lemma":"環境グループ","pos":["n"],"readings":["かんきょうグループ"]},{"common":false,"forms":["環境事業"],"glosses":["environmental business","environment business","environmental program"],"id":"1213300","lemma":"環境事業","pos":["n"],"readings":["かんきょうじぎょう"]},{"common":true,"forms":["環境庁"],"glosses":["Environment Agency"],"id":"1213310","lemma":"環境庁","pos":["n"],"readings":["かんきょうちょう"]},{"common":false,"examples":[{"en":"His official title is Director-General of the Environment Agency.","ja":"彼の公式の肩書きは環境庁長官です。","ref":"286189_117475","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["環境庁長官"],"glosses":["Director General of Environment Agency"],"id":"1213320","lemma":"環境庁長官","pos":["n"],"readings":["かんきょうちょうちょうかん"]},{"common":false,"forms":["環境配慮書"],"glosses":["envi